  "compatibility_notes": [
    "Added Lean4.35 module headers, public imports and exposed public definitions. Exposed formerly private helper definitions used in public statements or exposed definitions.",
    "Replaced coarse rational pi bounds with Mathlib's proved20-digit lower/upper bounds, and changed the computable shift choice to floor(midpoint/(2piHi)+1/2). The shift soundness theorem is valid for every integer, and all enclosure proofs were recompiled.",
    "Factored the existing sine/cosine coefficient-matching proofs into public exact list/Horner identities; the original interval membership theorems now reuse those identities. No Taylor theorem or remainder hypothesis changed."
  ]
}
